"PageList 管理存儲捲動歷史和活動終端機網格的底層頁面。每頁都是一塊連續的記憶體"
"緩衝區，擁有獨立的行、儲存格、樣式集、字素映射和超連結存儲。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:32
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概覽"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:39
msgid "Page Compression"
msgstr "頁面壓縮"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:46
msgid "Scrollbar & Regions"
msgstr "滾動條與區域"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:49
msgid "Scrollbar"
msgstr "滾動條"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:51
msgid "Regions"
msgstr "區域"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:56
msgid "Tracked Pins"
msgstr "跟蹤的定位點"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:63 src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:138
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "頁面"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:67
msgid ""
"Pages are shown most-recent first. Each page holds a grid of rows/cells plus "
"metadata tables for styles, graphemes, strings, and hyperlinks."
msgstr ""
"頁面按從新到舊的順序顯示。每頁包含行和儲存格網格，以及樣式、字素、字串和超連"
"結的元數據表。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:107
#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:690
msgid "(unable to copy compressed page)"
msgstr "（無法複製已壓縮的頁面）"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:130
msgid "Active Grid"
msgstr "活動網格"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:132
msgid "Active viewport size in columns x rows."
msgstr "活動視口大小，以列數 × 行數表示。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:140
msgid "Total number of pages in the linked list."
msgstr "鏈結串列中的頁面總數。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:146
msgid "Total Rows"
msgstr "總行數"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:148
msgid "Total rows represented by scrollback + active area."
msgstr "捲動歷史和活動區域的總行數。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:154
msgid "Scrollback Limit"
msgstr "捲動歷史上限"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:157
msgid ""
"Maximum uncompressed logical page memory before the oldest history is "
"evicted. Minimum page allocation sizes can make current usage temporarily "
"exceed this value."
msgstr ""
"淘汰最舊曆史記錄前允許的未壓縮邏輯頁面記憶體上限。最小頁面分配大小可能使當前"
"用量暫時超過此值。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:166
msgid "Viewport"
msgstr "視口"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:168
msgid "Current viewport anchoring mode."
msgstr "當前視口的錨定模式。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:186
msgid "Platform Support"
msgstr "平台支持"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:187
msgid ""
"Whether this target can discard physical page memory while retaining its "
"virtual address range. The scrollback-compression setting may still disable "
"automatic compression on a supported platform."
msgstr ""
"當前平台是否支持在保留虛擬地址範圍的同時釋放物理頁面記憶體。即使平台支持，"
"scrollback-compression 設置仍可能禁用自動壓縮。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:188
msgid "supported"
msgstr "支持"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:188
msgid "unsupported"
msgstr "不支持"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:195
msgid "resident"
msgstr "駐留"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:198
msgid "Page States"
msgstr "頁面狀態"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:199
msgid ""
"Compressed pages retain an encoded allocation while their raw mapping is "
"decommitted. Resident pages still have physical raw backing. Active, "
"visible, and recently changed pages are expected to be resident."
msgstr ""
"已壓縮的頁面保留編碼後的記憶體，並釋放原始映射對應的物理記憶體。駐留頁面仍保"
"留原始物理記憶體。活動、可見和最近修改的頁面應處於駐留狀態。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:205
msgid "Uncompressed Size"
msgstr "未壓縮大小"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:206
msgid ""
"Total size of all raw page mappings. This is the approximate page backing "
"memory required if no pages were compressed and is also the virtual address "
"space retained across compression."
msgstr ""
"所有原始頁面映射的總大小，近似表示所有頁面均未壓縮時所需的底層記憶體，也是壓"
"縮後仍保留的虛擬地址空間大小。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:222
msgid "encoded"
msgstr "編碼存儲"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:224
msgid "raw"
msgstr "原始記憶體"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:232 src/inspector/widgets/surface.zig:437
msgid "none"
msgstr "無"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:234
msgid "Compressed Storage"
msgstr "壓縮存儲"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:235
msgid ""
"Encoded allocation size compared with the original raw size of only the "
"compressed pages. The percentage is the compression ratio, so smaller is "
"better. Raw physical pages have been discarded."
msgstr ""
"僅比較已壓縮頁面的編碼後記憶體大小與原始大小。百分比為壓縮率，越小越好。原始"
"物理頁面已釋放。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:241
msgid "Estimated Resident"
msgstr "估算駐留記憶體"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:242
msgid ""
"Physical page backing estimated to remain after compression: resident raw "
"allocations, including unused pool tails, plus encoded storage. Node and "
"allocator metadata and unrelated terminal memory are excluded."
msgstr ""
"壓縮後預計保留的物理頁面記憶體：駐留的原始分配（包括記憶體池尾部未使用部分）"
"與編碼存儲之和。不含節點和分配器元數據及無關的終端機記憶體。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:254
msgid "Share of raw page memory"
msgstr "佔原始頁面記憶體比例"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:259
msgid "Estimated Savings"
msgstr "估算節省記憶體"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:260
msgid ""
"Physical page backing avoided across the complete PageList. This is "
"decommitted raw memory minus replacement encoded storage and is not a "
"measurement of total process RSS."
msgstr ""
"整個 PageList 節省的物理頁面記憶體，即已釋放的原始記憶體減去替代它的編碼存"
"儲，並非進程總駐留記憶體（RSS）的測量值。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:323
msgid "Total"
msgstr "總計"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:325
msgid "Total number of scrollable rows including scrollback and active area."
msgstr "可滾動的總行數，包括捲動歷史和活動區域。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:331
msgid "Offset"
msgstr "偏移量"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:333
msgid "Current scroll position as row offset from the top of scrollback."
msgstr "當前滾動位置，以相對於捲動歷史頂部的行偏移量表示。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:339
msgid "Length"
msgstr "長度"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:341
msgid "Number of rows visible in the viewport."
msgstr "視口中可見的行數。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:356
msgid "Region"
msgstr "區域"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:358
msgid "Top-Left"
msgstr "左上角"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:359
msgid "Bottom-Right"
msgstr "右下角"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:383
#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:392
msgid "(n/a)"
msgstr "（不適用）"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:401
msgid ""
"The active area where a running program can jump the cursor and make "
"changes. This is the 'editable' part of the screen. Bottom-right includes "
"the full height of the screen, including rows that may not be written yet."
msgstr ""
"運行中的程序可以移動游標和修改內容的活動區域，即螢幕中可編輯的部分。右下角涵"
"蓋螢幕的完整高度，包括尚未寫入的行。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:402
msgid ""
"The visible viewport. If the user has scrolled, top-left changes. Bottom-"
"right is the last written row from the top-left."
msgstr ""
"可見的視口。用戶滾動時左上角會變化。右下角是從左上角開始的最後一個已寫入行。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:403
msgid ""
"Top-left is the furthest back in scrollback history. Bottom-right is the "
"last written row. Unlike 'active', this only contains written rows."
msgstr ""
"左上角位於捲動歷史的最早位置，右下角位於最後一個已寫入行。與活動區域不同，這"
"裡僅包含已寫入的行。"

#: src/inspector/widgets/pagelist.zig:404
msgid ""
"Same top-left as 'screen' but bottom-right is the line just before the top "
"of 'active'. Contains only the scrollback history."
msgstr "左上角與螢幕區域相同，右下角位於活動區域頂部的前一行。僅包含捲動歷史。"

